**dualsense-edge.cpp does DualSense Edge report decoding and controller polling.**

## API

`decode_dualsense_edge(span<const byte>, connection, raw_sample&, canonical_sample&) noexcept -> bool` delegates `decode_dualsense(..., true)`.

`dualsense_edge_driver::poll(raw_sample&, canonical_sample&) noexcept -> bool` delegates `read_and_decode(..., true)`.